{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在《香港系列之細間始終你好》第 7 集中，主持人阮兆祥帶領觀眾走進隱藏於社區的小店，體驗三段屬於香港人的溫情故事，重拾那些逐漸被遺忘的傳統手藝與人情味。</p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><h4 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">旺角奇趣餅家：40 年手作唐餅的堅持</h4><p id=\"p-rc_3007410914074ede-394\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">屹立旺角花園街逾 40 年的「奇趣餅家」，是不少港人下午茶及逢年過節的必到之處。店內提供蛋散、雞仔餅、棋子餅及多款口味的老婆餅等傳統小食。第二代店主張惠寧（Willie）在學成歸港後，接手店舖經營與製作。</p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p id=\"p-rc_3007410914074ede-395\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">店內的招牌燒餅全憑老師傅的經驗控制火候，製作時將糯米粉築成粉牆，加入油糖及滾水拌勻，以達至糊化熟透。剛出爐的燒餅經吹風後，外皮焦香酥脆，內裡煙韌有嚼勁。Willie 曾坦言回港初期一度想進行大規模改革，但最終被師傅們對傳統手藝的執著所打動，選擇堅守這份香港街頭的動人風景。</p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>地址：</strong> 旺角花園街 135 號</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>營業時間：</strong> 星期一至日 08:00-19:30</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"88d2e392-2676-473c-aa6e-7af7ac30ba8c.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026Gn2gyF4DgE1784022251.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"88d2e392-2676-473c-aa6e-7af7ac30ba8c.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c20d466e-3c42-4ca9-aa8d-4abf000d38a6.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026EDPR5GQdUk1784022247.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c20d466e-3c42-4ca9-aa8d-4abf000d38a6.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ceeb8c81-14d9-4d78-afbe-9856837eefa4.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026IcN0vVJzgX1784022256.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ceeb8c81-14d9-4d78-afbe-9856837eefa4.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><h4 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">紅磡合成書局：70 年時光機的守護者</h4><p id=\"p-rc_3007410914074ede-396\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">位於紅磡的「合成書局」開業接近 70 年，歷經三代傳承，堪稱香港最古老的租書店之一。店主鍾先生的外公當年從街邊擺檔起家，後來門市結合士多與租書服務，直至因應舊區重建搬遷至現址。</p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p id=\"p-rc_3007410914074ede-397\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">在八、九十年代，這裡曾是年輕人的娛樂天堂，店內珍藏了大量《老夫子》、《牛仔》及《十三點》等經典漫畫。儘管閱讀習慣改變，鍾老闆為了服務一班支持了數十年的老街坊，即使面臨虧損依然堅持天天營業。對於行動不便的熟客，他更會親自送書上門，並陪伴聊天，這間小書店宛如一台時光機，守護著實體書獨有的溫情。</p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>地址：</strong> 九龍紅磡馬頭圍道 37-41 號紅磡廣場地庫 B88 號</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>營業時間：</strong> 星期一至星期六 12:00 – 20:00；星期日 15:00 – 18:00</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1b4d6849-1eab-4e82-97d9-94a77d027609.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026rbCrchu78l1784022297.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1b4d6849-1eab-4e82-97d9-94a77d027609.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"cd9df45a-a5b9-48bc-8d6e-50d87a1ee683.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20262BL6dtnlyi1784022302.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"cd9df45a-a5b9-48bc-8d6e-50d87a1ee683.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><h4 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">大角咀良順興：夫妻同心的「鍾無艷」煎肉餅</h4><p id=\"p-rc_3007410914074ede-398\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">大角咀巷弄內的「良順興」僅有二、三十個座位，背後蘊含老闆 Ken 與妻子 Candy 的愛情故事。為了讓妻子過上好日子，Ken 毅然創業，而 Candy 亦放棄原本的美容生意，陪伴丈夫在廚房捱過無數艱辛歲月。</p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p id=\"p-rc_3007410914074ede-399\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">招牌菜「鍾無艷煎肉餅」（85 元）採用 7 分瘦肉與 3 分肥肉的比例，內藏雞軟骨以增添爽脆口感，並透過摔打令肉餅起膠鎖住肉汁。Ken 教路，在家中煎肉餅時加入適量食水與蛋白，便能令口感滑溜鮮嫩。對 Ken 而言，經營過程雖不易，但只要客人食得開心，妻子感到幸福，一切付出皆是值得。</p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>地址：</strong> 大角咀博學里 9 號富多來商場一期地下 60 號</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>營業時間：</strong> 星期一至日 11:30-16:30，18:00-21:30</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"fc8c615c-15af-42c2-aa5c-65098fcdde3e.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026GPppUms6jo1784022331.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"fc8c615c-15af-42c2-aa5c-65098fcdde3e.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a4e7ceaa-f296-4c30-90a6-167cdb353c63.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026e9lmalf5b81784022335.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a4e7ceaa-f296-4c30-90a6-167cdb353c63.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e1d1a466-7545-4c70-858e-52c0d823c403.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026FhG5Opx0Vj1784022340.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e1d1a466-7545-4c70-858e-52c0d823c403.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e934bfc4-da75-4c3f-93b1-e740978ea741.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026Tfpl6Jwg211784022345.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e934bfc4-da75-4c3f-93b1-e740978ea741.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-15T06:03:36.918499+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1041,"images":9,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}